    "description": "Class III, mains-powered, self-indicating non-automatic weighing instruments fitted with a barcode scanner. The diecast base unit supports the load cell, barcode scanner assembly, main board and analogue boards; the scale sub-assembly is mounted on the load cell and the steel L-shaped load receptor is mounted on the four supporting points on the scale sub-assembly. Protected interfaces: POS terminal (RJ10), remote display (RJ4), auxiliary port (RJ10), scale host (RJ10), EAS port (RJ4), power (Molex 6). Optional one-piece Sensormatic EAS coil assembly. Additional LCD customer/operator display model 8300RD with single or dual display configuration."
